blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-24T12:37:30-07:00","id":1376424,"title":"","content":"I'm rereading The Wheel of Time. This is from the battle of Dumai's Wells.<br /> <br /> For those not familiar with Wheel of Time, there is this group of female magic users called Aes Sedai. Think Sidereals with how they rule behind the scenes as they advise every throne.<br /> <br /> Anywho, there are two groups of Aes Sedai at this point. The White Tower and the Rebels. Both sent delegations to the the protagonist, Rand. <br /> <br /> Anywho, the main group of Aes Sefai kidnapped Rand. And there was a battle. At the end of the battle some rebel Aes Sedai showed themselves as being party to the rescue. But that they didn't follow directions. To their detriment.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#545353\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">\u201cI forget nothing, Aes Sedai,\u201d Rand said coldly. \u201cI said six could come, but I count nine. I said you would be on an equal footing with the Tower emissaries, and for bringing nine, you will be. They are on their knees, Aes Sedai. Kneel!\u201d</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#545353\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Coldly serene faces stared back at him. He felt Asha\u2019man readying shields of Spirit. Defiance grew on Kiruna\u2019s face, on Bera\u2019s, on others. Two dozen black-coated men made a ring around Rand and the Aes Sedai.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#545353\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Taim appeared as close to a smile as Rand had ever seen him. \u201cKneel and swear to the Lord Dragon,\u201d he said softly, \u201cor you will be knelt.\u201d</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#545353\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br /> <br /> </span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3012-uknown-darklord","name":"Uknown DarkLord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3012_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-24T12:51:07-07:00","id":1376426,"title":"","content":"I really wish I could link Jack and The Ultra-bots episode on Youtube but I didn't find it.<br /> <br /> Here it is on Dailymotion : Starts at 17:30. I think I have never forgotten this scene from the first time I saw it, I found it so utterly cool.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dailymotion.com/video/x6tn16y\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dailymotion.com/video/x6tn16y\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dailymotion.com/video/x6tn16y\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.dailymotion.com/video/x6tn16y </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>"